@startuml
title "缩略图预览"用例交互顺序图
actor "机主" as User
boundary "主界面\nMainView" as MainView
control "目录扫描控制器\nDirectoryScannerControl" as ScanCtrl
control "数据库控制器\nDatabaseManagerControl" as DBCtrl
entity "目录节点\nDirectoryNode" as DirectoryNode
entity "图片实体\nImageFile" as ImageFile

User -> MainView : 1. 在目录树中选择目标文件夹
MainView -> ScanCtrl : 2. scanDirectory(path)
ScanCtrl -> DirectoryNode : 3. getChildren(path)
DirectoryNode --> ScanCtrl : 4. 返回子目录和文件路径
ScanCtrl -> ImageFile : 5. readSupportedImages(path)
ImageFile --> ScanCtrl : 6. 返回图片基本信息
ScanCtrl -> DBCtrl : 7. loadImageMetadata(paths)
DBCtrl --> ScanCtrl : 8. 返回缩略图缓存、标签、日志状态
ScanCtrl --> MainView : 9. 返回图片视图模型集合
MainView -> MainView : 10. renderThumbnails()
MainView --> User : 11. 展示缩略图网格和状态栏
@enduml
